# Pairs with ActiveTenantValidated. The region catalog annotates its answer
# with the asserted tenant even when the assertion was refused, echoing the
# caller's unvalidated header back.
MODULE: RegionsEchoRefusedTenant
TARGET: ActiveTenantValidated
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a refused tenant assertion is annotated back onto the region list
PERTURBS: CallRegions

--- FIND
        annot == IF honoured THEN hdr ELSE NoTenant
--- REPLACE
        annot == hdr
--- END
